mutant: m071_merge_leaves_bootstrap_live_seq
target: internal/ingest/orchestrator/disagg.go
failure-mode: |
  Merge's final transaction deletes the bootstrap_live namespace and writes
  phase=steady_state but leaves live_segments/seq/next behind (design
  §10.10). The catalog then holds a seq counter for a namespace with no
  segments, and a later bootstrap would resume bootstrap_live's seqs from
